Ladybird uses the surrounding language for automatic quotes and
uses the alternate pair for nested quotations. Blink reads ICU
delimiters in LayoutLocale::GetQuotesData(), as requested by
LayoutQuote::GetQuotesData(). Gecko selects them in GetQuoteForFrame().
WebKit passes the computed style’s locale from quoteMark() to
quotesForLanguage() to select a pair.

Chrome 157.0.8103.79 and Firefox 151.0 followed the surrounding
language for mixed-language quotes. WebKit 26.5 used the quote element’s
own language. Ladybird follows the CSS Working Group resolution on
mixed-language quotations.
